sequenceDiagram
    %% SD2 - Join a game
    %% Stories: 28, 29
    %% Description: An estimator opens the invitation URL and joins with a name, unless 15 estimators have already joined.
    actor EP as Estimator (person)
    participant G as Game
    participant E as Estimator

    EP->>G: open invitation URL and enter name [29]
    alt fewer than 15 estimators have joined [28]
        G->>E: create(name)
        G-->>EP: game view with the current item
    else game is full
        G-->>EP: cannot join, the game is full
    end
